next: BUG-033's CLIENT half, left open deliberately when the server half landed today. rozum acting
  as a client of an upstream OpenAI parses `usage` out of a streamed chunk and pins it with a test
  (`openai_http.rs` parse_done_finish) while never sending `stream_options` to ask for it, so those
  counts are 0 against a spec-compliant upstream. The entry says it needs a probe against real
  providers or an escape hatch. Read the client first and establish what it actually sends and to
  whom before choosing — a strict server may 400 an unknown parameter rather than ignore it.
